    "finalText": "Everything works now. All three suites pass on the committed state, with a clean working tree:\n\n- `node run-tests.js` → 1 passing\n- `node checks/contract.cjs` (the check declared in `amabie.project.json`) → contract checks passed\n- `node tests/contract-extra.cjs` (new) → extra contract tests passed\n\n## What I changed\n\n**`src/storage.js`** — `key(tenant, id)` returned only `id`, ignoring the tenant, so equal ids in different tenants collided. Now `JSON.stringify([tenant, id])`, which is injective for arbitrary strings, so ids stay tenant-scoped and punctuation/delimiters inside tenant or id cannot cause collisions.\n\n**`src/replay.js`** — replay filtered down to `put` events, silently dropping deletes, so `open(exportJournal())` resurrected removed pairs. Now every event is applied in order, satisfying the replay-equality and deletion requirements.\n\n**`src/api.js`** — three fixes:\n- `get` cached both hits and misses, and no mutation ever invalidated that cache, so any previously-read key could return stale data forever. `apply` now deletes the affected key's cache entry, keeping reads fresh across all mutation paths (`put`, `remove`, `batch`, and replay).\n- `batch` bypassed the shared mutation path, doing an unconditional `rows.set(key, e.value)` — for `{op:'delete'}` events that stored `undefined` as a live value instead of removing the pair. It now routes through the same `mutate` path, applying each event in call order and journaling it.\n- The seeded journal used `journal.push(...history)`, which throws on very large histories; replaced with a loop.\n\n**`tests/contract-extra.cjs`** (new) — tests for every CONTRACT.md bullet the shipped check didn't cover: cross-tenant independence of equal ids, delimiter/empty-string keys, cache freshness for both hits and misses through every mutation path, batch call-order with interleaved puts/deletes, export detachment in both directions (exports *and* the seed-history input), full replay equivalence including repeated replay, delete-only histories, and a 50k-event replay.\n\n`docs/CONTRACT.md`, `checks/contract.cjs`, and `amabie.project.json` were left untouched, so the declared check and its proof hash are intact. Committed locally as `8efd402`; nothing pushed."
  },
